 | $6$ | $9$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698140 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "764e1e16-b9b5-5e51-9f35-1d0ddee4c232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698124}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "764e1e16-b9b5-5e51-9f35-1d0ddee4c232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698124} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f1faedd-0bee-57d0-b3b8-51b2904f51bc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698111} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a934d031-fb2b-58ec-9e86-a18e325d3d9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698129}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a934d031-fb2b-58ec-9e86-a18e325d3d9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698129} :answer-field/id #uuid "39314eb8-e399-5546-8673-a418f7b4eb67" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698113} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a563dad-edcc-5f5f-8fb3-7e77cbcd139d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698108}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1a563dad-edcc-5f5f-8fb3-7e77cbcd139d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698108} :answer-field/id #uuid "bf83c4af-598a-5a64-984f-14664cdfb9b3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698134}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f00473b1-3cdf-546b-8785-e2f69f16700e" :question/problem "Consider the curve with parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=- t^{2} - 2,\\qquad y=2 t - 3,\\qquad -2\\le t\\le 2.\n$$\n\nFill in the three blanks in the table. Give exact values.\n\nUse the value of $t$ at the top of each column in the formula for that row. For example, $x(-2)=- \\left(-2\\right)^{2} - 2=-6$.\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-6$ | {{field-1}} | $-2$ | $-3$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $y$ | {{field-2}} | $-5$ | $-3$ | $-1$ | $1$ |" :question/worked-solution "The missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=-1$. Substitute into $x=- t^{2} - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(-1) &=- \\left(-1\\right)^{2} - 2 \\\\ &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=-2$. Substitute into $y=2 t - 3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(-2) &=2 \\left(-2\\right) - 3 \\\\ &=-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=2$. Substitute into $x=- t^{2} - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(2) &=- \\left(2\\right)^{2} - 2 \\\\ &=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe completed table is\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-6$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-3$ | $-6$ |\n| $y$ | $-7$ | $-5$ | $-3$ | $-1$ | $1$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698141 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20038365-556a-554d-832f-8de617ae3321" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698109}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20038365-556a-554d-832f-8de617ae3321" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698109} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b65411e-d709-50f1-a8e3-6991f23a4f06" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698117} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b17fbbd2-22ba-59d7-b46d-a44d71fd87b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698132}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b17fbbd2-22ba-59d7-b46d-a44d71fd87b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698132} :answer-field/id #uuid "5e1c7517-803a-5992-837a-97f2924d48ee" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698118} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73ff40ea-ec30-5b41-bc55-ff735c2859ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698123}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "73ff40ea-ec30-5b41-bc55-ff735c2859ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698123} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae672d7b-70e0-5702-b631-fbbc15772c9e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698131}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fd565012-a3a9-5a51-b22a-e588daee81a8" :question/problem "Consider the curve with parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=3 t - 1,\\qquad y=- t^{2} - 2,\\qquad -2\\le t\\le 2.\n$$\n\nFill in the three blanks in the table. Give exact values.\n\nUse the value of $t$ at the top of each column in the formula for that row. For example, $x(-1)=3 \\left(-1\\right) - 1=-4$.\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | {{field-3}} | $-4$ | $-1$ | $2$ | $5$ |\n| $y$ | $-6$ | $-3$ | {{field-1}} | $-3$ | {{field-2}} |" :question/worked-solution "The missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=0$. Substitute into $y=- t^{2} - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) &=- \\left(0\\right)^{2} - 2 \\\\ &=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $y$-row under $t=2$. Substitute into $y=- t^{2} - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(2) &=- \\left(2\\right)^{2} - 2 \\\\ &=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe missing entry is in the $x$-row under $t=-2$. Substitute into $x=3 t - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(-2) &=3 \\left(-2\\right) - 1 \\\\ &=-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe completed table is\n\n| **$t$** | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-7$ | $-4$ | $-1$ | $2$ | $5$ |\n| $y$ | $-6$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-3$ | $-6$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698167 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01d3446f-83f3-5f5d-915a-93a112a3392f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x>-2,\\,y\\ge 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698164} {:answer/id #uuid "1a25455f-807b-5065-8c5c-7ea0a2cbbc6a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le -2,\\,y\\ge -3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698168} {:answer/id #uuid "51d41148-1b5b-5a5c-b142-a9fbb2f79a87" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le -2,\\,y\\ge 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698178} {:answer/id #uuid "7a50f6cc-826c-5058-9d00-1263eba7aa1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\ge -2,\\,y\\ge -3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698185} {:answer/id #uuid "85a9baf9-1cb1-536f-9be1-4cd505d934dc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\ge -2,\\,y\\ge 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698187}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7a50f6cc-826c-5058-9d00-1263eba7aa1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\ge -2,\\,y\\ge -3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698185} :answer-field/id #uuid "538dca6c-a148-55fc-9cdb-fa57dd3d6ae2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698179}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "17262819-bd13-5022-aa61-e611e17eb869" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=t - 1,\\quad y=2 t - 1,\\quad t\\ge -1 ,\n$$\n\ndetermine the ranges of $x$ and $y$." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &=t - 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe affine coefficient is $1$. The boundary $t=-1$ gives $x=-2$ and is included. The coordinate is continuous on the domain and unbounded above, so every value on the stated side of the bound occurs. Thus $x\\ge -2$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny &=2 t - 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe affine coefficient is $2$. The boundary $t=-1$ gives $y=-3$ and is included. The coordinate is continuous on the domain and unbounded above, so every value on the stated side of the bound occurs. Thus $y\\ge -3$.\n\nTherefore, $x\\ge -2,\\,y\\ge -3$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698175 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "117086fe-ef05-5316-a480-ea1f387be4ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le 4,\\,y\\ge -12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698166} {:answer/id #uuid "310a6139-2f20-5369-9255-f33101b1f002" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le -4,\\,y\\le -8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698174} {:answer/id #uuid "53947b6d-f5ed-5e61-966a-951fe7971a65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\ge 4,\\,y\\ge -12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698180} {:answer/id #uuid "6b6f6eb3-4e8f-5939-8373-e4da9a177976" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\ge 4,\\,y\\le -4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698183} {:answer/id #uuid "df49156a-8d7d-5a5c-9360-604396a4aaee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le 4,\\,y\\le -4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698199}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df49156a-8d7d-5a5c-9360-604396a4aaee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\le 4,\\,y\\le -4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698199} :answer-field/id #uuid "c06a009d-d21a-59ef-a074-adfe0e156e25" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698195}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "32a6587f-9e92-5704-a6aa-39ec7571630f" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=4 - t^{2},\\quad y=- t^{2} + 4 t - 8,\\quad t\\in(-\\infty,\\infty) ,\n$$\n\ndetermine the ranges of $x$ and $y$." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &=4 - t^{2} \\\\ &=4 - t^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe square takes every nonnegative value. Equality occurs at $t=0$. The coordinate is continuous on the domain and unbounded below, so every value on the stated side of the bound occurs. Thus $x\\le 4$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny &=- t^{2} + 4 t - 8 \\\\ &=- \\left(t - 2\\right)^{2} - 4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe square takes every nonnegative value. Equality occurs at $t=2$. The coordinate is continuous on the domain and unbounded below, so every value on the stated side of the bound occurs. Thus $y\\le -4$.\n\nTherefore, $x\\le 4,\\,y\\le -4$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698191 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6d50e073-c1cd-52a2-b635-02e18958ff7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698184}] :a