2186698266} :answer-field/id #uuid "c2711225-32f2-5791-aea9-2d84843c9cca" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698255} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3298b7f-af75-5403-b3a3-41d0c01ec847" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698262}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e3298b7f-af75-5403-b3a3-41d0c01ec847" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698262} :answer-field/id #uuid "da74d408-002e-57c8-865d-5b713ad7b684" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698260}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5935a7ef-e601-5c95-9723-497e03564394" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=4\\cos\\theta+3,\\qquad y=-2\\sin\\theta-3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $3$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-1 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta+3\\le 7 \\\\\n-1 &\\le x\\le 7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le x\\le 7$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n-1 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le y\\le -1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le y\\le -1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698230 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16b9dc48-eebf-502c-977c-badd808c44f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16b9dc48-eebf-502c-977c-badd808c44f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698210} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b230695-0a73-53a6-95f6-b98f092aaa15" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698213} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0caf2744-972b-57cf-8003-a6ff2ac71d4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698206}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0caf2744-972b-57cf-8003-a6ff2ac71d4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698206} :answer-field/id #uuid "57aa2e32-602a-57fb-8d4e-6793ab748525" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698225} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "109fcc2b-4825-53b6-b38f-b887208533d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "109fcc2b-4825-53b6-b38f-b887208533d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/