ield/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698245}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "60fa7064-5626-5afa-a435-48058884a534" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=4\\cos\\theta+1,\\qquad y=4\\sin\\theta-3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $1$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-3 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta+1\\le 5 \\\\\n-3 &\\le x\\le 5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-3\\le x\\le 5$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $-3$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\sin\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-7 &\\le 4\\sin\\theta-3\\le 1 \\\\\n-7 &\\le y\\le 1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-7\\le y\\le 1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698242 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e76904c-2bb7-59d7-b51f-dd205700019b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698207}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e76904c-2bb7-59d7-b51f-dd205700019b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698207} 