 values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n-1 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le x\\le -1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le x\\le -1$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $2$ and translate by $-2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-2 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta\\le 2 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta-2\\le 0 \\\\\n-4 &\\le y\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le y\\le 0$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698254 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af841084-5621-5238-a454-3fef18387f50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698249}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "af841084-5621-5238-a454-3fef18387f50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698249} :answer-field/id #uuid "7c2edacd-c089-55d4-9e48-9f9dfee4b315" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698237} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0770a829-e010-537f-8953-9fb78e1e494d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698205}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0770a829-e010-537f-8953-9fb78e1e494d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698205} :answer-field/id #uuid "8d68fc28-68db-5396-9456-d8e000b6c843" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type