 #uuid "045072b6-3a9d-58be-a1d1-7572d47f563c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698204}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "045072b6-3a9d-58be-a1d1-7572d47f563c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698204} :answer-field/id #uuid "e4c1fd21-60c4-5c4c-afeb-a7bd4a15810d" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698263}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "be01a2ea-10e1-5016-b260-166998db09c2" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=-3\\sin\\theta-3,\\qquad y=-4\\cos\\theta+3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-3$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-3\\sin\\theta\\ge-3 \\\\\n0 &\\ge-3\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-6 \\\\\n-6 &\\le x\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-6\\le x\\le 0$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-4$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n4 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta\\ge-4 \\\\\n7 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta+3\\ge-1 \\\\\n-1 &\\le y\\le 7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le y\\le 7$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698382 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3515a8fb-f8ca-5f6a-a2d3-1613902a4bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698383}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3515a8fb-f8ca-5f6a-a2d3-1613902a4bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698383} :answer-field/id #uuid "0dd44b2c-1572-5b31-830c-478decc13bf7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698377} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "596b9fce-9d0e-5f7e-bc22-de8edf178da1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698388}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "596b9fce-9d0e-5f7e-bc22-de8edf178da1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698388} :answer-field/id #uuid "93c44676-5b96-5ade-a6e8-f72945cfff38" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698393} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a02dfa0a-5c24-5d27-b9dc-fb3309689d42" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698395}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a02dfa0a-5c24-5d27-b9dc-fb3309689d42" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698395} :answer-field/id #uuid "ca36a1da-c564-503c-9469-bd34be789af1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698396}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "32b03ef2-c9e7-5ca4-8ead-9864878a056c" :question/problem "Let $a=k+3i-2j$ and $b=2j+4k-i$. Use a determinant to find $a\\times b$.\n\nEnter each signed coefficient, including any minus sign.\n\n$a\\times b=$ {{field-1}} $i\\,+\\,$ {{field-2}} $j\\,+\\,$ {{field-3}} $k$" :question/worked-solution "First collect the coefficients in $i,j,k$ order: $a=\\langle 3,-2,1\\rangle$ and $b=\\langle -1,2,4\\rangle$. The order in which the terms are written does not change their coordinate positions.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na\\times b\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}i&j&k\\\\3&-2&1\\\\-1&2&4\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1\\\\2&4\\end{vmatrix}i\n-\\begin{vmatrix}3&1\\\\-1&4\\end{vmatrix}j\n+\\begin{vmatrix}3&-2\\\\-1&2\\end{vmatrix}k\\\\\n&=((-2)(4)-(1)(2))i\\\\\n&\\quad-((3)(4)-(1)(-1))j\\\\\n&\\quad+((3)(2)-(-2)(-1))k\\\\\n&=(-8-2)i-(12+1)j+(6-2)k\\\\\n&=-10i-13j+4k.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe three entries are $-10$, $-13$, and $4$. The plus signs printed between the fields combine signed coefficients; they do not make a negative coefficient positive."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698391 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75fdef5f-8445-5f74-b768-ce5875156354" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75fdef5f-8445-5f74-b768-ce5875156354" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698389} :answer-field/id #uuid "4e1a0440-04b4-5fad-b889-3d05e8a2815e" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698386} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf853cf0-f41b-5b88-8801-28c9730c69df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698397}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cf853cf0-f41b-5b88-8801-28c9730c69df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698397} :answer-field/id #uuid "557e7a19-cb8b-5d7a-b340-3fcb185ae7c4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698387} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16992f67-3e00-53b7-9d56-9f82a75367d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No changes." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698379} {:answer/id #uuid "8fa28709-c2d5-5915-b6f0-e6c4554ab937" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Swap rows only." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698392} {:answer/id #uuid "e73c1f48-bece-52fe-9ff7-cd363032a078" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Fix sign only." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698400} {:answer/id #uuid "eed13e28-3a31-5f73-a7a3-25a01a7904b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Swap rows; fix sign." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698401}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eed13e28-3a31-5f73-a7a3-25a01a7904b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Swap rows; fix sign." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698401} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f02ac61-ba0a-5e2a-a4da-659943ee8a1e" :answer-field/key "correction" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698394} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37710011-f695-5d85-b0de-a6f0564139db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698384}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37710011-f695-5d85-b0de-a6f0564139db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698384} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1e7de65-019d-5984-b3ad-9b529e797947" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698398}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "7b05d98a-447a-5e23-a68a-1402f57431f7" :question/problem "Let $a=2k-i+3j$ and $b=-2j+4i+k$. A student tries to calculate $a\\times b$ by writing\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{vmatrix}i&j&k\\\\4&-2&1\\\\-1&3&2\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nand then expanding along the top row using the cofactor signs $+,+,+$.\n\nWhich correction makes the setup and cofactor signs correct for $a\\times b$?\n\n{{correction}}\n\nNow calculate $a\\times b$ using the corrected determinant. Enter each signed coefficient.\n\n$a\\times b=$ {{field-1}} $i\\,+\\,$ {{field-2}} $j\\,+\\,$ {{field-3}} $k$" :question/worked-solution "Read the coordinates in $i,j,k$ order: $a=\\langle -1,3,2\\rangle$ and $b=\\langle 4,-2,1\\rangle$. For $a\\times b$, the second row must contain $a$ and the third row must contain $b$. The student's rows are reversed. Independently, the top-row cofactor signs must be $+,-,+$, not $+,+,+$.\n\nThus both corrections are needed: swap the vector rows and change the middle cofactor sign.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na\\times b\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}i&j&k\\\\-1&3&2\\\\4&-2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}3&2\\\\-2&1\\end{vmatrix}i\n-\\begin{vmatrix}-1&2\\\\4&1\\end{vmatrix}j\n+\\begin{vmatrix}-1&3\\\\4&-2\\end{vmatrix}k\\\\\n&=((3)(1)-(2)(-2))i\\\\\n&\\quad-((-1)(1)-(2)(4))j\\\\\n&\\quad+((-1)(-2)-(3)(4))k\\\\\n&=(3+4)i-(-1-8)j+(2-12)k\\\\\n&=7i+9j-10k.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSwapping the rows alone leaves a middle-sign error. Fixing the cofactor signs alone calculates $b\\times a$ instead. The signed entries for the requested product are $7$, $9$, and $-10$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698399 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16764f42-10e6-5eb6-83ce-170002a8c671" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle 2,-4,7\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698378} {:answer/id #uuid "182c1d68-e2f4-50d1-869b-cb67c31044ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle -2,4,7\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698380} {:answer/id #uuid "19fea1e1-0e7d-533c-ae4c-9d87e5086087" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle 2,4,-7\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698381} {:answer/id #uuid "408d946f-4c07-5658-806a-375ba24fd17c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle 2,-3,0\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698385} {:answer/id #uuid "f72fe75e-d7c1-5f9f-8291-424fa5e2fa80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle -2,-4,7\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698402}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f72fe75e-d7c1-5f9f-8291-424fa5e2fa80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\langle -2,-4,7\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698402} :answer-field/id #uuid "7743cffa-7d46-583e-83b5-481b04964552" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e66e28d8-0d2e-5c3d-8958-72f1cf78332d" :question/problem "Let $u=\\langle 2,-1,0\\rangle$ and $v=\\langle 1,3,2\\rangle$. Use a determinant to find $u\\times v$." :question/worked-solution "Put $u$ in the second row and $v$ in the third row. Expand along the first row with signs $+,-,+$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu\\times v\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}i&j&k\\\\2&-1&0\\\\1&3&2\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&=\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0\\\\3&2\\end{vmatrix}i\n-\\begin{vmatrix}2&0\\\\1&2\\end{vmatrix}j\n+\\begin{vmatrix}2&-1\\\\1&3\\end{vmatrix}k\\\\\n&=((-1)(2)-(0)(3))i\\\\\n&\\quad-((2)(2)-(0)(1))j\\\\\n&\\quad+((2)(3)-(-1)(1))k\\\\\n&=-2i-4j+7k\\\\\n&=\\langle -2,-4,7\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe middle minor is $4$, but the middle component is $-4$ because its cofactor carries a minus sign."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698403 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36dee86e-333e-5f7b-86b5-ba324a4ad24e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b9/b9224c557b69de03ea28941e4bfae9f75441a2cd34fa35376293c9bb90f30a11.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698411} {:answer/id #uuid "62b69988-b261-52dd-845b-9c30c221fe0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b5/b5155b2b7b7222fe2e819bd4629209de4afc99a08eb0157f1cd46bcd9667e7a0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698415} {:answer/id #uuid "793025dd-0c4c-55b6-805b-e66719d3ffa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/24/248c6c0b1b98280cdfb1a9dae706a5c6d2b90ecc5dfe51c88874608c3e65a4d1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698420} {:answer/id #uuid "7deb2763-ec55-550a-8ad6-6cfa0ea792b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f8/f836a60a37bfa0bcb5a3f951257513453f783d35dd0e0aa4b30b66bc614dc50a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698423} {:answer/id #uuid "a2ddf828-abda-5606-82c0-141e05fa3387" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/28/283396a457998690f493989fc872176a301322c7265eebd063c454d0c6ece465.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698427}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "62b69988-b261-52dd-845b-9c30c221fe0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b5/b5155b2b7b7222fe2e819bd4629209de4afc99a08eb0157f1cd46bcd9667e7a0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698415} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa0c5a85-778d-5c7b-9cbb-bec073c2cebf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698437}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "00a0ab7a-aa47-5ff6-b5b5-cd1e4da4a88e" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=3 - 4 t\\\\ y&=t - 1\\\\ &-3\\le t\\le 3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=3 - 4 t$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ \\hline x & 15 & 11 & 7 & 3 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & -5 & -9 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t - 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ \\hline x & 15 & 11 & 7 & 3 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y & -4 & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & -5 & -9 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/f8/f87af4c6b109422b771adb8747bd3e9eedb2c36bf77604ecd6b73c3fc50a8a1c.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698404 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cd7a60b-5de7-5d32-8895-26ade289098d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/97/97abb6b632e75fcc604b943a3e01bd78079f7a4140f53949bda39956ae0bfbef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 1