athbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t + 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y & 4 & 5 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/11/110abee7113f372d21760b21b3d5bb937ac30d16cba61b8a143b4a00136d1ed7.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698408 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b1db5b1-daab-58da-b1a8-4fdbd37f1cc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/89/895bf6c6adaae07f4c4cfb6436ff1216b9893cf25200b59106cf668a79ed71aa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698416} {:answer/id #uuid "6df2db16-8ef4-5189-89fe-8017c9024827" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5d/5d3f6794f841c796739b344f94622a7be2738b885f880e113ff8e902d24c42eb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698418} {:answer/id #uuid "744e910b-fead-584b-a161-471a8875b411" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/bb/bb77b9631eddf462bd42fff76d0f00402fdec1032b24514116e9dbbd93d267f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698419} {:answer/id #uuid "9725f2a5-cd28-5edd-9965-6d1006713660" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6d/6d7bc901b3a0a9504f68660803823667bcb9804929b965f7c70ec8d83c4cab64.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698426} {:answer/id #uuid 