& 1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{2 \\pi}{3} & \\pi & \\frac{4 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 1 & 1 - 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{5 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 2 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 - 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/42/4257b66e25b49edbc656a9f008b54eb60c3dd811bf666307cf3b7bf20c74d04e.png)"}]}
